  "description": "The Samedi 28.4 is the most fully equipped model in the family. It has all the qualities of its little brother: a wide, easy-to-step-over frame, an integrated battery that offers even more range, and a Bosch Performance Smart System motor that’s even more powerful and responsive, for even more joyful rides! It also features Smart System connectivity, such as customizable assistance modes and the eBike Lock, which allows the bike to be locked when stationary. It can even be optionally equipped with the Bosch ConnectModule, which includes an alarm function and allows you to track the bike’s location. Smile after smile, with peace of mind. Also available with a closed frame.",
